{
  "title": "Proxmox (pve)",
  "uid": "homelab-proxmox",
  "description": "Ersetzt das Fremd-Dashboard 24550, das fuer den prometheus-pve-exporter gebaut ist: von dessen 50 Metriken liefert der hier laufende bigtcze/pve-exporter nur 22, der Rest der Panels blieb leer. Kein SMART, keine Disk-Temperaturen, kein IO-Wait, keine Netz-Zaehler auf Node-Ebene. Das ist kein Verlust, denn pve haengt seit 2026-08-07 zusaetzlich als node-exporter mit drin: Temperaturen, Disk-IO und Netz auf Blech-Ebene stehen im Dashboard Node Overview. Dieses Board zeigt, was nur die Proxmox-API weiss, also die Gaeste und die Storages.",
  "tags": ["homelab", "proxmox"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": { "list": [] },
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "pve",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 3, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max(pve_node_up)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "mappings": [
            { "type": "value", "options": { "1": { "text": "online", "color": "green", "index": 0 } } },
            { "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "DOWN", "color": "red", "index": 1 } } }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Uptime",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 3, "x": 3, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max(pve_node_uptime_seconds)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "s", "decimals": 0, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "text" } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "CPU",
      "description": "pve_node_cpu_load heisst so, ist aber die CPU-Auslastung als Anteil von 0 bis 1, kein Load-Average. Das echte Load-Average von pve steht im Node Overview (node_load1).",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 3, "x": 6, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max(pve_node_cpu_load)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.8 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.9 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "RAM",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 3, "x": 9, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max(pve_node_memory_used_bytes) / max(pve_node_memory_total_bytes)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.85 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.95 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Swap",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 3, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max(pve_node_swap_used_bytes) / clamp_min(max(pve_node_swap_total_bytes), 1)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.2 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.5 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "VMs",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 15, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "count(max by (vmid) (pve_vm_status) == 1) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "laufend",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "count(max by (vmid) (pve_vm_status))",
          "legendFormat": "gesamt",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "text" } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "orientation": "horizontal"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "LXCs",
      "description": "Fehlen hier Container, die auf pve laufen, dann fehlen dem API-Token die Rechte darauf: der Exporter listet nur, was die Proxmox-API ihm zeigt.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 5, "x": 19, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "count(max by (vmid) (pve_lxc_status) == 1) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "laufend",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "count(max by (vmid) (pve_lxc_status))",
          "legendFormat": "gesamt",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "text" } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "orientation": "horizontal"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CPU-Auslastung pve",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max(pve_node_cpu_load)",
          "legendFormat": "pve"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": false },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single", "sort": "none" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Speicher pve",
      "description": "Belegt und gesamt als absolute Werte, damit sichtbar bleibt, wie viel Luft fuer weitere VMs da ist.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 4 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max(pve_node_memory_used_bytes)",
          "legendFormat": "belegt"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max(pve_node_memory_total_bytes)",
          "legendFormat": "gesamt"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max(pve_node_swap_used_bytes)",
          "legendFormat": "Swap"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 0, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "gesamt" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "text" } },
              { "id": "custom.lineStyle", "value": { "dash": [6, 6], "fill": "dash" } }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max"], "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Storage-Füllstand",
      "description": "nvme-2tb ist die 2TB-NVMe auf /mnt/nvme-2tb, dort liegen die Disks von k3s-worker-1 und vm-arch (frueher longhorn-storage). nas-nfs ist der NFS-Mount vom UniFi-NAS, local-lvm traegt die restlichen VM-Disks.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 4 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max by (storage, type) (pve_storage_used_bytes / clamp_min(pve_storage_total_bytes, 1))",
          "legendFormat": "{{storage}} ({{type}})",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.8 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.9 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "showUnfilled": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Gäste",
      "description": "VMs und LXCs in einer Tabelle. Das Typ-Label entsteht per label_replace, weil der Exporter VMs und Container in getrennten Metrikfamilien fuehrt. Belegter Gast-Speicherplatz fehlt absichtlich: pve_vm_disk_used_bytes ist ohne QEMU-Guest-Agent immer 0, deshalb steht hier nur die zugewiesene Disk-Groesse.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 12 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "label_replace(max by (name, vmid) (pve_vm_status), \"typ\", \"VM\", \"name\", \".*\") or label_replace(max by (name, vmid) (pve_lxc_status), \"typ\", \"LXC\", \"name\", \".*\")",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max by (name) (pve_vm_cpu_usage) or max by (name) (pve_lxc_cpu_usage)",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max by (name) (pve_vm_cpus) or max by (name) (pve_lxc_cpus)",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max by (name) (pve_vm_memory_used_bytes / clamp_min(pve_vm_memory_max_bytes, 1)) or max by (name) (pve_lxc_memory_used_bytes / clamp_min(pve_lxc_memory_max_bytes, 1))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "E",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max by (name) (pve_vm_disk_max_bytes) or max by (name) (pve_lxc_disk_max_bytes)",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "F",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max by (name) (pve_vm_uptime_seconds) or max by (name) (pve_lxc_uptime_seconds)",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        { "id": "joinByField", "options": { "byField": "name", "mode": "outer" } },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "Time 1": true,
              "Time 2": true,
              "Time 3": true,
              "Time 4": true,
              "Time 5": true,
              "Time 6": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "name": "Name",
              "vmid": "ID",
              "typ": "Typ",
              "Value #A": "Status",
              "Value #B": "CPU",
              "Value #C": "vCPUs",
              "Value #D": "RAM",
              "Value #E": "Disk",
              "Value #F": "Uptime"
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "name": 0,
              "vmid": 1,
              "typ": 2,
              "Value #A": 3,
              "Value #B": 4,
              "Value #C": 5,
              "Value #D": 6,
              "Value #E": 7,
              "Value #F": 8
            }
          }
        },
        { "id": "sortBy", "options": { "fields": {}, "sort": [{ "field": "ID" }] } }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": { "align": "auto", "cellOptions": { "type": "auto" } },
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Status" },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  { "type": "value", "options": { "1": { "text": "running", "color": "green", "index": 0 } } },
                  { "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "stopped", "color": "text", "index": 1 } } }
                ]
              },
              { "id": "custom.cellOptions", "value": { "type": "color-text" } }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byRegexp", "options": "CPU|RAM" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "unit", "value": "percentunit" },
              { "id": "decimals", "value": 1 },
              { "id": "max", "value": 1 },
              { "id": "min", "value": 0 },
              { "id": "custom.cellOptions", "value": { "type": "gauge", "mode": "gradient" } },
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    { "color": "green", "value": null },
                    { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.8 },
                    { "color": "red", "value": 0.9 }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Disk" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "unit", "value": "bytes" },
              { "id": "decimals", "value": 1 }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Uptime" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "unit", "value": "s" }]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "footer": { "show": false, "reducer": ["sum"], "countRows": false, "fields": "" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Netzwerk pro Gast (rx + tx)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 22 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max by (name) (rate(pve_vm_network_in_bytes_total[5m]) + rate(pve_vm_network_out_bytes_total[5m])) or max by (name) (rate(pve_lxc_network_in_bytes_total[5m]) + rate(pve_lxc_network_out_bytes_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{name}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "Bps",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 5, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max"], "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Disk-IO pro Gast (lesen + schreiben)",
      "description": "Aus Sicht des Hypervisors, also was auf local-lvm landet. Das ist die Zahl, die bei qcow2-Bloat und beim Longhorn-Replica-Verkehr zaehlt.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 22 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max by (name) (rate(pve_vm_disk_read_bytes_total[5m]) + rate(pve_vm_disk_write_bytes_total[5m])) or max by (name) (rate(pve_lxc_disk_read_bytes_total[5m]) + rate(pve_lxc_disk_write_bytes_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{name}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "Bps",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 5, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max"], "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    }
  ]
}
